title: Payers › Every pop-up › Save, discard, close
route: /payers/:id
intro: One page for how every Payers pop-up closes. Nothing is saved by closing: Cancel, the X, Escape and a click on the dimmed area all throw away what was typed, with no 'are you sure'. Escape closes only the top layer, so a menu, then the pop-up over a drawer, then the drawer each take one press. There is no undo; a saved edit is reversed by editing again, and the edit log keeps the old text.
dir: TD
---
start s1 "Any Payers pop-up is open"
overlay ov "Pop-ups and panels\nAdd a payer, Edit payer details, Edit log (drawer),\nEdit rule (drawer), Save the rule?, Mark as verified, Archive a rule?,\nEdit what a payer wants, Acknowledge this change?, Update drafts?,\nRestore as draft?, the workflow version panel, plus the menus inside them"

group gX "Ways to close"
  click x1 "Click 'Cancel'"
  click x2 "Click the X ('Close')"
  click x3 "Press Escape"
  click x4 "Click the dimmed area outside"
endgroup

process cl "The top layer is asked to close\nEscape only ever reaches the top layer"
decision dk "Which pop-up is it?"
process pl "Plain pop-up (everything except the cases below)\nCloses. Typed text and picks are discarded\nNothing is saved or logged"
process rd "Edit log\nRead only, nothing to save or discard"
process sv "'Save the rule?' over the Edit rule drawer\nCancel, X, Escape or the dimmed area:\nonly this reason modal closes"
process dr "The drawer is still open with every edit in it\nA second Escape, Cancel, X or dimmed area closes it:\nevery unsaved rule edit is lost, no 'are you sure'"
process bz "'Update drafts?' while the agents work (about 3 seconds)\nCancel is greyed, Escape, X and dimmed area do nothing\nWait for it to finish"
process mn "A menu open inside a pop-up\n(Plan type, Insurance type, State, Reached by, Level of care, Case, Workflow)\nEscape closes only the menu\nThe next Escape closes the pop-up"

group gS "Ways to save (the primary button)"
  process sa "'Save and log the edit' needs a reason\nEmpty reason: 'Add a reason. It goes in the edit log.'\n'Edit payer details' also needs a listed 'Reached by'"
  process sb "'Add payer' needs a name no other payer has,\na way to reach and a program"
  process sc "'Acknowledge change' and 'Update N drafts' are confirm buttons;\n'Mark as verified' needs a source and a date\nthey need no typing"
  process sd "If nothing differs from what is saved:\n'Nothing changed' (or 'Nothing to save' in the workflow drawer)"
endgroup

store sv1 "Saved: the change is in force for new drafts\nOne edit log entry per change\nOne bell notification"
process undo "No undo, revert or 'restore previous' button\nTo go back: edit again. Edit log shows the before text"
end e1 "Back on the page, nothing half saved"
endx x0 "Closed without saving"

s1 --> ov
ov --> x1 & x2 & x3 & x4
x1 --> cl
x2 --> cl
x3 --> cl
x4 --> cl
cl --> dk
dk -->|Plain| pl --> x0
dk -->|Edit log| rd --> x0
dk -->|Save the rule?| sv --> dr --> x0
dk -->|Update drafts?, busy| bz --> e1
dk -->|Menu open| mn --> x0
ov --> sa --> sv1
ov --> sb --> sv1
ov --> sc --> sv1
sa --> sd
sv1 --> e1
e1 -.-> undo
